ssful matchmaking.\n<Assistant_Title2>3. Reward Rules: </>\n<Assistant_Title3>① Plot Events: </>Complete to claim rewards.\n<Assistant_Title3>② Challenge Events: </>Racing challenges distribute rewards based on ranking; Fierce Battle · Bonnie has tiered rewards based on performance; difficult boss events do not have tiered rewards.\n<Assistant_Title3>③ Competition Events: </>Rewards are distributed based on final ranking.\n<Assistant_Title2>4. Reward Cap: </>There is no limit to the number of times event rewards can be claimed, but there is a weekly cap on the Bounty Value that can be obtained. You can continue to participate in events after reaching the cap, but you will not continue to receive Bounty Value.\n<Assistant_Title2>5. Failure Conditions: </>\nFailure to complete event objectives within the specified time.\nLeaving the event area too far during the event is considered a voluntary abandonment.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>香槟金属・手工镶嵌\n由鲁恩顶级珠宝商推出的化装舞会面饰，据说灵感来自于佛尔思·沃尔女士那篇患者面部开花的恐怖小说。当然，他们做了不少美化。"] = "<DecH>Craft: </>Champagne Metal & Hand-Inlaid\nA masquerade mask launched by a top Loen jeweler, said to be inspired by Ms. Fors Wall's horror novel about a patient whose face blooms with flowers. Of course, they made quite a few aesthetic adjustments.",
    ["<HighLight>卡牌能量</>达到5点时才可释放。消耗5点<HighLight>卡牌能量</>，在2.7秒内持续向锁定目标发射卡牌，对目标及其小范围内敌方造成12次spellfielddisc(*id)点物理伤害，并<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">打断</>敌方怪物，施法过程中可以释放其他技能和移动。\n只要本技能处于可释放状态，<HighLight>终结技能</>就不会切换至<HighLight>命运愚弄</>或<HighLight>灵性爆发</>，但它们依然可通过收集<HighLight>命运黄牌</>或<HighLight>灵性蓝牌</>解锁，并在本技能释放后立刻进入可用状态。"] = "Can only be released when <HighLight>Card Energy</> reaches 5 points. Consume 5 points of <HighLight>Card Energy</> to continuously fire cards at the locked target for 2.7 seconds, dealing spellfielddisc(*id) physical damage 12 times to the target and enemies in a small area, and <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">interrupting</> enemy monsters. You can release other skills and move while casting. \nAs long as this skill is available, the <HighLight>Finisher Skill</> will not switch to <HighLight>Fooling of Fate</> or <HighLight>Spirituality Burst</>, but they can still be unlocked by collecting <HighLight>Fooling of Fate Yellow Cards</> or <HighLight>Spirituality Blue Cards</> and will become available immediately after this skill is cast.",
