    ["邓恩与戴莉联手追查，发现孤儿尤朵拉因天生能听到呓语而被视为怪胎，在济贫院饱受虐待。她被极光会成员兰尔乌斯蛊惑，获得骨笛引诱渴望逃离家庭的孩子。戴莉通灵发现失踪儿童之灵，尤朵拉因失控被骨笛反噬。危急时刻，卡萝队长附身夜莺银哨，以最后的力量吹奏摇篮曲，驱散骨笛的邪恶力量。卡萝在守护廷根与阿诺德后消散，提醒众人去自由地大笑、尽情地相爱、幸福地活着。你将迟到的礼物送至墓园，告慰逝者。"] = "Dunn and Daly join forces to investigate and discover that the orphan Yodora is treated as a freak because she can hear whispers from birth and suffers abuse in the poorhouse. She is seduced by Ince Zangwill of the Aurora Order, obtaining a bone flute to lure children who long to escape their families. Daly uses spirit mediumship to find the spirits of the missing children, and Yodora is backlashed by the bone flute due to loss of control. At the critical moment, Captain Daly possesses the Nightingale Silver Whistle and uses her final strength to play a lullaby, dispelling the evil power of the bone flute. After protecting Tingen and Arnold, Daly dissipates, reminding everyone to laugh freely, love passionately, and live happily. You deliver the late gift to the cemetery to comfort the deceased.",
